Bug 1883816 - Defer select event during typematic key repeat in TreeListboxMixin. r=aleca

Holding ArrowUp/ArrowDown in the folder pane caused the UI to freeze and
then jump to an unpredictable position on key release. This happened
because every typematic keydown dispatched a "select" event, which
triggered expensive folder-loading work (closing/opening DBViewWrappers)
that couldn't keep up at key-repeat rates.

Now the visual selection (highlighting and scrolling) still updates on
every repeated keystroke for smooth feedback, while the "select" event
is deferred until keyup/blur, so the folder loads only once on the
final position.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313308


